# Keep the build context to what the Dockerfile actually COPYs: the encoder weights
# under .cache/models, the materialized corpus, the two pinned JSON files and the
# runner. Traces in output/ can reach hundreds of MB and would be sent to the daemon
# on every build.
output/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
README.md
requirements.txt
benchmark.py
prepare.py
